<title>JAPAN: TIFFE Euroyen ends up in Tokyo, boosted by FOMC.</title>
<headline>TIFFE Euroyen ends up in Tokyo, boosted by FOMC.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sept 25 settlement  prev settlement</p>
<p> TIFFE Euroyen 3M (H)     99.22		  99.18</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The key three-month Euroyen futures contract ended Wednesday's day session moderately higher due to the Federal Open Market Committee's (FOMC) decision on Tuesday to leave interest rates steady.</p>
<p>&quot;The FOMC's decision to keep interest rates unchanged made it easier to buy bonds. Against this backdrop, there is no reason to sell Euroyen futures for the time being,&quot; said a city bank trader.</p>
</text>
